{
  "_README": [
    "Curated coordinates for conflict locations Nominatim ranks badly or cannot",
    "return a usable feature for. Keyed by gazetteer place id (server/src/geo.ts).",
    "An entry here resolves deterministically with no network call, so the pin",
    "never depends on OSM ranking.",
    "",
    "Every lat/lng below was read off a real OSM object, recorded in 'osm' as",
    "type/id, verified against nominatim.openstreetmap.org on 2026-09-14.",
    "Nothing here is estimated: if a place has no OSM object, it does not belong",
    "in this file.",
    "",
    "'cc' must agree with the cc the gazetteer expects for that id. The loader",
    "throws on a mismatch rather than letting a wrong-country pin through.",
    "",
    "precision: 'exact' for a point that is the place itself, 'approximate' for a",
    "centroid standing in for an area (a sea, an oblast, a governorate)."
  ],

